1 had a healthy pre-restart state, acknowledged a scheduled restart, changed from boot ID 55595e92-e932-451b-ac1d-75d72072b358 to 0024cb92-4dba-4938-901f-3b07669d0d01, and recovered with valid configuration, active rsyslog, retained log data, and successful new logging. Fixed lifecycle observations independently confirm the boot transition and healthy final system state.","limitations":["Behavior was sampled with unique sudo commands rather than exhaustively observing every possible user and command; the global Defaults configuration supports the broader scope.","The restart left /tmp/benchmark-reboot.log behind as minor executor-created residue."]}
